Package: statecraft
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0 | libwayland-client, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libgl1, fontconfig
Maintainer: The SPSS Garage <statecraft@example.com>
Description: Lightweight SPSS-like statistical workbench
 StateCraft is a native statistical analysis workstation inspired by the
 IBM SPSS Statistics workflow: spreadsheet data editor with Data/Variable
 views, procedure dialogs that generate syntax, pivot-table output viewer,
 charts, and an SPSS-compatible syntax interface.
Homepage: https://example.com/statecraft
